+{% block content %}
+<div class="legal-hero">
+  <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
+  <p>The terms that apply when you use this website and book with us</p>
+</div>
+
+<div class="legal-body">
+  <div class="legal-note">
+    By using this website or sending an inquiry, you agree to these terms.
+    Please read them alongside our
+    <a href="{{ url_for('main.privacy_policy') }}">Privacy Policy</a>.
+  </div>
+
+  <h2>About us</h2>
+  <p>
+    Travel Worthy PH is a travel agency based in Batangas City, Philippines. We
+    arrange tour packages and provide visa assistance.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Inquiries are not bookings</h2>
+  <p>
+    Submitting an inquiry through this website does not create a booking or
+    reserve any slot. It is a request for a quotation. A booking exists only
+    once we have confirmed it with you directly and any required payment has
+    been arranged and received.
+  </p>
+  <p>
+    This website does not process payments. Any payment arrangement is made
+    separately with our team.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
+  <p>
+    Prices shown are indicative starting rates per person and can change
+    without notice. Final pricing depends on your travel dates, group size,
+    room arrangement, airline fares, and availability at the time of booking.
+  </p>
+  <p>
+    Travel dates listed on a package are planned departures. Availability is
+    confirmed only when we respond to your inquiry.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Your responsibilities</h2>
+  <ul>
+    <li>Give accurate details when you inquire, including names as they appear on travel documents</li>
+    <li>Hold a passport valid for the period required by your destination</li>
+    <li>Obtain any visa required for your trip</li>
+    <li>Arrive at departure points on time</li>
+  </ul>
+  <p>
+    We assist with visa applications but cannot guarantee any visa outcome. A
+    refused visa is decided by the embassy or consulate concerned, not by us.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Changes and cancellations</h2>
+  <p>
+    Changes and cancellations follow the terms of the airlines, hotels, and
+    operators involved in your trip. Those terms vary by supplier and are
+    confirmed to you before you commit to a booking. Some bookings are
+    non-refundable.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Third party services</h2>
+  <p>
+    Your trip involves airlines, hotels, transport providers, and local
+    operators. We arrange these on your behalf. We are not responsible for
+    their acts or omissions, or for delays, cancellations, or disruptions
+    outside our control, including weather and government action.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Website content</h2>
+  <p>
+    We take care to keep package details, itineraries, and images accurate, but
+    content may change. Images are illustrative of the destination and may not
+    show the exact hotel, room, or vehicle used on your trip.
+  </p>
+  <p>
+    Content on this website belongs to Travel Worthy PH or its licensors and
+    may not be copied or reused without permission.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Reviews and submitted content</h2>
+  <p>
+    If you post a review or photo, you confirm it is your own and you allow us
+    to display it on this website. We may remove content that is misleading,
+    offensive, or not yours to post.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2>Contact</h2>
+  <p>
+    Questions about these terms can be sent through our
+    <a href="{{ url_for('main.contact') }}">contact page</a>.
+  </p>
+</div>
+{% endblock %}
